00:15:36,960 --> 00:15:38,680
他们一定认为那不可能是
They couldn't possibly think one person

353
00:15:38,680 --> 00:15:40,244
一个人的呕吐量
was responsible for all that.

354
00:15:40,244 --> 00:15:42,520
再说了 我不想扔下你
Plus, I don't want to leave you.

355
00:15:42,520 --> 00:15:43,180
你不舒服
You're sick.

356
00:15:43,440 --> 00:15:45,160
比不舒服严重多了
I think it's beyond sick.

357
00:15:45,600 --> 00:15:47,360
我把骨质都吐出来了
I lost bone mass in there.

358
00:15:48,200 --> 00:15:50,280
我现在鞋子都嫌大了
My shoes are too big now.

359
00:15:51,260 --> 00:15:52,520
真是好丢脸啊
I'm so embarrassed!

360
00:15:52,720 --> 00:15:53,900
这是常有的事
Hey, it happens.

361
00:15:54,280 --> 00:15:55,200
你肚子疼而已
You got a stomach ache.

362
00:15:55,360 --> 00:15:56,880
你只是不习惯吃有钱人吃的食物
You're just not used to rich food.

363
00:15:57,060 --> 00:15:58,920
我不习惯有钱人的任何玩意
I'm not used to rich anything.

364
00:15:59,440 --> 00:16:01,120
如果兰迪的世界是这样...
And if this is Randy's world...

365
00:16:01,920 --> 00:16:04,280
鸟骨头和做作的人们
uh, bird bones and pretentious people...

366
00:16:04,280 --> 00:16:08,080
那或许我的身体在告诉我 我接受不了
then maybe my body is telling me I can't take it.

367
00:16:08,980 --> 00:16:11,900
麦克斯 如果我能习惯在便利店买耳环
Max, if I got used to buying earrings at the AMPM,

368
00:16:13,280 --> 00:16:15,660
那你也能习惯精美的食物 做作的人们
you can get used to fancy food and pretentious people.

369
00:16:15,860 --> 00:16:16,738
你不明白
You don't get it!

370
00:16:16,738 --> 00:16:19,180
他是为了我才搬来这里
He is moving here for me.

371
00:16:19,180 --> 00:16:20,960
是哦 你也这么觉得吗
Oh, do you think so?

372
00:16:21,540 --> 00:16:22,820
真希望你的好闺蜜
I wish your best friend

373
00:16:22,820 --> 00:16:24,520
在过去两天有跟你一直念叨这件事
had been telling you that for two days.

374
00:16:24,720 --> 00:16:26,140
他要把他整个人生搬来这里
He's moving his whole life.

375
00:16:26,140 --> 00:16:27,740
我不知道该怎么办
I don't know how to do that.

376
00:16:27,740 --> 00:16:30,760
就连他给我搬椅子时 我都不知道该作何反应
I didn't even know how to react when he moved my chair for me.

377
00:16:31,220 --> 00:16:32,520
你说得对 这无关食物
You were right, it's not about the food;

378
00:16:32,520 --> 00:16:33,420
这事关我们的未来
it's about our future,

379
00:16:33,420 --> 00:16:35,680
而我刚吐了我们的未来一脸
and I just vomited all over our future.

380
00:16:37,760 --> 00:16:38,200
干嘛
What?

381
00:16:39,900 --> 00:16:41,820
我很不想这么说 但你需要来一颗薄荷糖
I hate to say this, but you need a mint.

382
00:16:42,920 --> 00:16:45,380
抱歉 我爱你 但你需要来一颗薄荷糖
Sorry, I love you, but you need a mint.

383
00:16:46,080 --> 00:16:47,740
我需要消失
I need to disappear.

384
00:16:48,520 --> 00:16:50,220
你觉得希拉·纽曼[新生]这名字怎么样
What do you think of the name Sheila Newman?

385
00:16:52,460 --> 00:16:52,900
麦克斯
Max!

386
00:16:53,680 --> 00:16:54,120
兰迪
Randy.

387
00:16:54,460 --> 00:16:56,220
太棒了 正好赶上看我跳下去
Great, just in time to see me jump.

388
00:16:57,740 --> 00:16:59,300
怎么回事 你们去哪儿了
What happened? Where'd you go?

389
00:16:59,500 --> 00:17:01,040
我太快跳上自行车
Oh, I jumped on that bike so fast,

390
00:17:01,080 --> 00:17:02,820
我的"兄弟们"再也不会跟我说话了
my man parts are no longer talking to me.

391
00:17:03,580 --> 00:17:05,500
她不舒服 不想被你看见
She didn't want to be sick in front of you.

392
00:17:06,180 --> 00:17:06,960
你不舒服吗
You got sick?

393
00:17:08,360 --> 00:17:09,860
好啦 我们都听见了
Okay, fine, we all heard it.

394
00:17:10,240 --> 00:17:12,340
但你为什么一句话不说就走了
But why did you leave without saying something?

395
00:17:12,720 --> 00:17:14,500
因为话语是唯一一样
Because words were the only thing

396
00:17:14,500 --> 00:17:15,900
不会从我嘴巴出来的东西
not coming out of my mouth.

397
00:17:17,900 --> 00:17:18,380
麦克斯
Max?

398
00:17:19,960 --> 00:17:21,060
你不看着我吗
You're not gonna look at me?

399
00:17:21,660 --> 00:17:22,620
我不能
I can't.

400
00:17:22,960 --> 00:17:24,180
等等 给
Wait, here.

401
00:17:24,720 --> 00:17:25,480
现在她能了
Now she can.

402
00:17:26,600 --> 00:17:27,920
你最好快回去
You better get back there.

403
00:17:27,980 --> 00:17:29,120
我不想你失去这份工作
I don't want you to lose that job.

404
00:17:29,720 --> 00:17:30,900
我不想要这份工作
I don't want that job.

405
00:17:31,400 --> 00:17:32,980
我都不知道玛丽莎吃了多少药
I don't know how many more pills Marissa took,

406
00:17:32,980 --> 00:17:34,780
但她晕倒在一锅清蒸蛤蜊里
but she passed out in a pot of clam steam.

407
00:17:36,040 --> 00:17:37,480
我错过了清蒸蛤蜊吗
I missed clam steam?

408
00:17:37,900 --> 00:17:40,020
杂志上老提他做的清蒸蛤蜊
I've been reading about his clam steam.

409
00:17:40,420 --> 00:17:42,360
拜托不要再说"清蒸蛤蜊"
Please stop saying "clam steam."

410
00:17:42,840 --> 00:17:44,820
我都可以闻得到这四个字的味儿了
I can actually smell the words.

411
00:17:45,940 --> 00:17:46,420
好吧 麦克斯
Okay, Max.

412
00:17:46,420 --> 00:17:47,900
你又开始面如菜色了
You are starting to turn green again,

413
00:17:47,980 --> 00:17:51,000
要不你坐上来 我会骑自行车送你回家
so why don't you hop on, and I will ride you home

414
00:17:51,000 --> 00:17:52,320
像个爷们一样载你
on my bicycle like a real man.

415
00:17:52,920 --> 00:17:54,180
我不知道 兰迪
I don't know, Randy.

416
00:17:54,320 --> 00:17:56,360
一顿饭的时间 很多东西涌上来
A lot of stuff came up for me at that dinner.

417
00:17:56,640 --> 00:17:57,880
我不止是说
And I'm not just talking about

418
00:17:57,880 --> 00:18:00,240
我今年吃过的每一样东西
every single thing I ate this year.

419
00:18:00,840 --> 00:18:03,680
或许我不适合你
I mean, maybe I'm not right for you.

420
00:18:06,140 --> 00:18:08,040
今晚的事 你别太苛责自己了
Don't be so hard on yourself about tonight.

421
00:18:08,480 --> 00:18:09,380
你看我
I mean, look at me.

422
00:18:09,600 --> 00:18:11,160
我也没有勇气去你打工的餐厅吃饭啊
I'm not brave enough to eat in that diner.

423
00:18:12,160 --> 00:18:14,124
过来
Come here, you.

424
00:18:14,680 --> 00:18:16,640
或许再等60秒会更好
Maybe wait another 60 seconds.

425
00:18:19,200 --> 00:18:20,720
我知道我们不一样
I think we are different.

426
00:18:20,720 --> 00:18:22,980
但我们也算合拍
But we kind of go together.

427
00:18:23,240 --> 00:18:25,600
就像撒胡椒的幼鸟膀胱和香蒜酱
Like peppered baby bird bladder and pesto.

428
00:18:27,400 --> 00:18:28,680
完蛋了 完蛋了
Oh, no. Oh, no.

429
00:18:28,680 --> 00:18:29,300
天啊
Oh, my God.

430
00:18:30,440 --> 00:18:32,020
我要吐了
That's gonna do it!

431
00:18:36,900 --> 00:18:39,220
今晚开敞篷车真是中了"大奖"啊
Wrong night to be driving a convertible.

432
00:18:41,460 --> 00:18:43,780
等等 别跳别跳
Oh, wait... no, no, no, no, no, no.

433
00:18:52,260 --> 00:18:54,380
你第一个餐厅汉堡如何啊
So how's your first diner burger?

434
00:18:55,400 --> 00:18:56,400
还不错
It's not bad.

435
00:18:57,320 --> 00:18:58,518
好像有吃到什么
I'm getting a little something.

436
00:18:58,518 --> 00:18:59,787
豆子吗[跟蚊子谐音]
Um... mesquite?

437
00:19:00,120 --> 00:19:01,960
是啊 他们被灭蚊器弄死
Yeah, they die in the fan

438
00:19:01,960 --> 00:19:03,360
然后尸体掉到了烤肉架上
and then fall on the grill.

439
00:19:05,440 --> 00:19:08,340
我宁愿吃蚊子汉堡也不吃鹈鹕
I'll take mosquito burger over pelican any day.

440
00:19:09,360 --> 00:19:10,580
真有意思 兰迪
Interesting, Randy.

441
00:19:10,800 --> 00:19:13,800
有两名服务员在专心服务你
You get two waitresses paying attention to you

442
00:19:13,800 --> 00:19:15,600
而大多数人一个都没有
and most people get none.

443
00:19:16,220 --> 00:19:17,820
就像那边那个
Like that one over there,

444
00:19:17,920 --> 00:19:20,140
还有那边 以及那边那个男士
over there, and that gentleman over there

445
00:19:20,140 --> 00:19:21,680
等得不耐烦 都要走了
who's just giving up and leaving.

446
00:19:23,100 --> 00:19:24,560
行了 阿憨 我们去吧台边上
Fine, Han, we will go over to the counter

447
00:19:24,560 --> 00:19:25,620
继续聊天了
and continue to talk.

448
00:19:28,700 --> 00:19:31,540
我知道我老说你
I know I say a lot of stuff about you,

449
00:19:31,540 --> 00:19:32,720
尤其爱当面说你
especially to your face,

450
00:19:33,040 --> 00:19:34,840
但谢谢你昨晚的帮忙
but thank you for your help last night.

451
00:19:35,120 --> 00:19:37,100
我知道你也会为我做同样的事
I know you would have done the same thing for me.

452
00:19:37,100 --> 00:19:38,760
但如果我有这么不舒服
But if I ever get that sick,

453
00:19:38,760 --> 00:19:40,220
我准许你杀了我
you have my permission to kill me.

454
00:19:40,600 --> 00:19:43,340
当你走进那间厕所 为我找掉了的耳环时
I mean, when you went into that toilet, looking for my earring,

455
00:19:43,720 --> 00:19:45,860
我就知道我找到了我的后性爱伴侣
I knew I had found my post-sex partner.

456
00:19:47,420 --> 00:19:49,680
你居然为她这么做吗
You did that for her?

457
00:19:51,700 --> 00:19:54,280
一直以来 我们在寻找完美的一对
And all this time, we've been looking for

458
00:19:54,280 --> 00:19:56,760
给我们孩子当干爹妈
the perfect couple to be godparents,

459
00:19:56,760 --> 00:19:59,120
而她们就在我们眼皮底下
and they're right under our noses.

460
00:20:00,379 --> 00:20:03,440
女女干妈妈
Girl-on-girl godparents.

461
00:20:03,440 --> 00:20:04,420
我喜欢
I like it.

462
00:20:05,049 --> 00:20:08,560
你们俩姑娘一定能跟我宝宝好好相处
You two girls are gonna be great with the baby.

463
00:20:08,560 --> 00:20:09,660
我是说 卡洛琳
I mean, Caroline,

464
00:20:09,840 --> 00:20:12,360
你半只胳膊伸进去掏麦克斯的呕吐物
you were elbow-deep in Max's upchuck.

465
00:20:12,360 --> 00:20:15,360
我亲爹我都不会愿意为他这么做
I mean, I wouldn't even do that for my own father

466
00:20:15,360 --> 00:20:17,480
当时他吞下了所有的蜜蜂
when he swallowed all those bees.

467
00:20:19,040 --> 00:20:21,500
苏菲 这真是对我莫大的夸奖
Wow, Sophie, this is such a huge compliment.

468
00:20:21,860 --> 00:20:23,900
虽然是夹在一个可怕的个人回忆里面
Tucked away in a terrible personal memory.

469
00:20:25,000 --> 00:20:27,959
如果我们俩出了什么事
Well, if something would ever happen to us,

470
00:20:27,959 --> 00:20:30,513
让麦克斯来喂奶
let Max do the breast feeding.

471
00:20:31,220 --> 00:20:33,340
因为我可不想我的小孩饿死
'Cause, yeah, I don't want the kid to starve.

472
00:20:35,000 --> 00:20:36,100
这真让人兴奋
This is exciting!

473
00:20:36,620 --> 00:20:38,460
兰迪 我要当干爹啦
Randy, I'm gonna be a godfather.

474
00:20:39,018 --> 00:20:40,340
同样让人兴奋的是
And equally as exciting,

475
00:20:40,340 --> 00:20:42,640
我也要从那个厕所的窗户爬出去啦
I'm gonna be climbing out of that bathroom window

476
00:20:42,640 --> 00:20:43,860
就在差不多两分钟后开爬
in about two minutes.
